Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.52,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(382,77)}North-South Badge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.52,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs29\)\pos(280,563)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a great discovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I might win the Nobel prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Northern ends of the magnet approach closer, they just repel away..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So do the Southern ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If S end and N end get closer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They stick together, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it interesting? I discovered it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please! Who doesn't even know that {\i1}simple{\i0} thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it already when I was in the Kindergarten. You're such a slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.31,0:00:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you make fun of me in front of everyone! Stop, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.42,0:01:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to remember this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When you turn up next time, I will make sure to beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it in mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so talkative...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, please do something, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You live in the same neighborhood and go to same school
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what, you would have to come face-to-face with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,An idea! There's a way that you don't have to see each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna take out some gadget?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's North-South Badges!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How to use them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,if you stick this on your back...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be like a magnet, Southern ends go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and vise versa...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's conduct an experiment!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you have to put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick one on Mum too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, Dad asked you to see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,what's up, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.46,0:02:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See, she's repelled by the badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here dear, grab my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, I want to hold you! Stop going farther away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But my body just bounced away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous, you don't like me anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They ended up fighting each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to change one of the badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird, I can't approach you for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy ending for Mum and Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you understand....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You stick South badge on your back...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and stick the South badge on Giant's back as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let me go stick this on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Giant ain't got a thing on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay for you to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant said he's going to tear you up to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.91,0:03:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he can try it if he can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Things have got really interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I just have to provoke Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita you jerk, I am going to tear you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, I saw Nobita over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's show time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:03:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the badge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not on him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita ran away very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How handy the badges are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,An idea! Lend me some more badges!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you need them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make very good use of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I won't be pulled away so easily!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge for yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,North-South Badge sure is powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I stuck the wrong badge! I should have stuck this one! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just need to switch the badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to take off my shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, where is Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,GIant is chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.89,0:06:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, help me out, please do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get Giant down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't, just switch Giant and Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to use it to fool around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about you anymore!
